# This repo is developed on Windows but builds on Linux in CI. Anything the
# Linux side executes or parses must stay LF: a shell script checked out with
# CRLF dies with "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M", which reads like a
# missing-bash problem rather than a line-ending one.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
